00:26:55.643 --> 00:26:58.452
100%, like I had some crazy hustles.

00:26:58.452 --> 00:27:00.082
I had one all-time hustle

00:27:00.082 --> 00:27:02.022
that has to do with basketball.

00:27:02.022 --> 00:27:07.022
The Dollar Stores popped up
in the '90s, like '91 '92.

00:27:07.022 --> 00:27:09.802
At first, I know everyone
here's a youngster,

00:27:09.802 --> 00:27:12.742
at first, youngsters,
Dollar Stores weren't

00:27:12.742 --> 00:27:13.575
like they are now

00:27:13.575 --> 00:27:14.662
where they have like new stuff

00:27:14.662 --> 00:27:15.832
and it's made for The Dollar Store.

00:27:15.832 --> 00:27:18.482
At first, it was some real shit

00:27:18.482 --> 00:27:19.922
like there was warehouses.

00:27:19.922 --> 00:27:21.282
The internet didn't exist yet.

00:27:21.282 --> 00:27:23.482
So you couldn't get rid of
stuff on Amazon or Ebay.

00:27:23.482 --> 00:27:26.132
There were warehouses
filled with old stuff

00:27:26.132 --> 00:27:27.462
and here came The Dollar Store

00:27:27.462 --> 00:27:30.002
and they're just selling
stuff, like old-style,

00:27:30.002 --> 00:27:32.370
I remember I bought a ton of Rambo toys

00:27:32.370 --> 00:27:36.046
that were 1984 toys but
I was buying them in 1992

00:27:36.046 --> 00:27:36.912
'cause they were just in a warehouse,

00:27:36.912 --> 00:27:38.502
just old stuff, Zelda books,

00:27:38.502 --> 00:27:39.779
like that was what I was looking up

00:27:39.779 --> 00:27:40.842
but there's all sorts of stuff.

00:27:40.842 --> 00:27:42.937
Anyway, one day I go to The Dollar Store

00:27:42.937 --> 00:27:45.755
and they have Shaq figures.

00:27:47.152 --> 00:27:48.352
Shaq made huge noise,

00:27:48.352 --> 00:27:50.102
obviously when he came to the league

00:27:50.102 --> 00:27:50.942
the same way he is now,

00:27:50.942 --> 00:27:52.699
