00:27:52.699 --> 00:27:54.442
And there was a Shaq toy line.

00:27:54.442 --> 00:27:55.522
But what was weird about this

00:27:55.522 --> 00:27:57.732
was this had just come
out like a year earlier

00:27:57.732 --> 00:27:59.412
but they were in The Dollar Store.

00:27:59.412 --> 00:28:00.412
So I looked at it,

00:28:00.412 --> 00:28:03.252
so I bought all 25 that were in the store,

00:28:03.252 --> 00:28:04.762
I started walking down the mall

00:28:04.762 --> 00:28:07.252
