cards and other collectibles

00:28:07.252 --> 00:28:09.732
and I noticed there was
Shaq figures in there

00:28:09.732 --> 00:28:11.105
and they were $9.99.

00:28:12.032 --> 00:28:13.282
So I was like huh,

00:28:13.282 --> 00:28:17.282
so I bought something
at Kmart to get the bag,

00:28:17.282 --> 00:28:19.482
I went back into the food court,

00:28:19.482 --> 00:28:21.962
I put the Shaq figures I
bought at the Dollar Store

00:28:21.962 --> 00:28:23.192
into the Kmart bag

00:28:23.192 --> 00:28:24.712
and I went back to Kmart and I was like,

00:28:24.712 --> 00:28:26.962
yo my grandma bought me these toys,

00:28:26.962 --> 00:28:28.312
I don't really want them.

00:28:28.312 --> 00:28:29.962
I don't have a receipt, can I refund 'em?

00:28:29.962 --> 00:28:31.283
And they were like, yeah

00:28:31.283 --> 00:28:33.822
and I'm like without a receipt

00:28:33.822 --> 00:28:35.712
and cash not store credit?

00:28:35.712 --> 00:28:37.962
Again, this is 1991,

00:28:37.962 --> 00:28:40.062
Kmart didn't have their shit together yet.

00:28:41.982 --> 00:28:42.965
So then I went,

00:28:43.865 --> 00:28:45.342
so I took five of them,

00:28:45.342 --> 00:28:46.182
I returned them,

00:28:46.182 --> 00:28:48.702
I got 50 bucks back for what
I just paid five bucks for

00:28:48.702 --> 00:28:50.532
about 45 minutes earlier.

00:28:50.532 --> 00:28:51.852
Then I went back to the dollar,

00:28:51.852 --> 00:28:52.685
I'm still in the mall,

00:28:52.685 --> 00:28:53.952
Phyllis Mall, big shout out,

00:28:53.952 --> 00:28:56.182
you look like a fucking disaster now

